<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Page Not Found - RunnerSpace</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<style>
	html, body {
		height: 100%;
		margin: 0;
		font-family: "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
		background: #f4f6f8;
		color: #33393f;
	}
	.wrap {
		min-height: 100%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 24px;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}
	.card {
		background: #ffffff;
		border-radius: 10px;
		box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
		max-width: 460px;
		width: 100%;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 48px 36px 40px;
	}
	.code {
		font-size: 84px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		color: #ff6600;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 22px;
		margin: 16px 0 8px;
		color: #1c1f22;
	}
	p {
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: #6b7680;
		margin: 0 0 28px;
	}
	.home-link {
		display: inline-block;
		background: #ff6600;
		color: #ffffff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 600;
		padding: 12px 28px;
		border-radius: 6px;
		transition: background 0.15s ease-in-out;
	}
	.home-link:hover {
		background: #e55a00;
	}
</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="card">
			<p class="code">404</p>
			<h1>We couldn't find that page</h1>
			<p>The link you followed may be broken, or the page may have been moved or removed.</p>
			<a class="home-link" href="/">Back to RunnerSpace</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
